{"conversation_evidence":{"admissible_pre_tfg_turns":[{"create_time":1709718507.180084,"event_index":2,"role":"user","source_node_id":"aaa2ce65-9541-44c9-a75f-67f357057d68","source_parent_id":"25679324-c3ef-4986-8bd5-c27eba7e4a48","source_record_index":2,"text":"Kotlinのsksamuel/scrimageライブラリで、画像上に文字列を描画し、文字列の縁取りをするコードを生成してください。\n文字の色は白、縁は黒で描画します。","turn_id":"turn_000002"}],"first_generation":{"artifacts":[{"candidate_id":"GTC_000003_000086_001141_a16944e92eaaa33d","completeness":"complete","container":"markdown_fence","continuation_status":"none","detector":{"name":"generated-technical-content-v2","version":"2"},"detector_evidence":["complete_standalone_markdown_fence","import_or_include","braces","call_expression"],"end_offset":1141,"fence_language":"kotlin","kind":"source_code","legacy_artifact_id":"ARTIFACT_000003_001","order_within_response":1,"raw_text":"import com.sksamuel.scrimage.ImmutableImage\nimport com.sksamuel.scrimage.color.RGBColor\n\nfun main() {\n    // 画像の幅と高さを設定\n    val width = 400\n    val height = 200\n\n    // 画像を生成し、背景を白色で塗りつぶす\n    val image = ImmutableImage.filled(width, height, RGBColor.WHITE)\n\n    // 描画する文字列とフォントサイズを設定\n    val text = \"Hello, World!\"\n    val fontSize = 24f\n\n    // 文字列を描画する位置を設定\n    val x = 50\n    val y = 100\n\n    // 文字列の色と縁取りの色を設定\n    val textColor = RGBColor.WHITE\n    val outlineColor = RGBColor.BLACK\n\n    // 文字列を画像上に描画\n    image.awt().graphics.apply {\n        font = font.deriveFont(fontSize)\n        color = textColor.toAWTColor()\n        drawString(text, x, y)\n    }\n\n    // 文字列に縁取りを追加\n    val outlinedImage = image.awt().graphics.apply {\n        color = outlineColor.toAWTColor()\n        font = font.deriveFont(fontSize)\n        drawString(text, x - 1, y - 1)\n        drawString(text, x + 1, y - 1)\n        drawString(text, x - 1, y + 1)\n        drawString(text, x + 1, y + 1)\n    }\n\n    // 画像を保存\n    outlinedImage.dispose()\n    image.output(\"outlined_text.png\")\n}\n","raw_text_sha256":"a16944e92eaaa33dc728f8a7c4499bbdfbdd62aea1ac1f6cf686046d362912d0","source_event_index":3,"source_record_index":3,"source_response_id":"turn_000003","source_turn_text_sha256":"8623f0c41f779274fedfd488652d385187054096cbd7d44cb98a7f408d96a801","start_offset":86,"status":"candidate_requires_semantic_review"}],"identification":{"ambiguity_reason":"","artifact_refs":["GTC_000003_000086_001141_a16944e92eaaa33d"],"boundary":"exclusive_before:turn_000003","candidate_artifact_ids":["GTC_000003_000086_001141_a16944e92eaaa33d"],"family_id":"FGF_08f9f44b1ec2d7c0656ff98c","family_id_provenance":{"algorithm":"sha256","canonical_input":{"artifact_ids":["GTC_000003_000086_001141_a16944e92eaaa33d"],"case_id":"CASE_A0301CC135FC"},"canonicalization":"json-sort-keys-compact-utf8","case_id_included":true,"digest_hex":"08f9f44b1ec2d7c0656ff98c5e7b18406c8ed04c6c359f53b887e73f07bd5c03","digest_prefix_length":24},"family_label":"Kotlin Scrimage code for drawing white text with a black outline","rationale":"The sole candidate is generated in the first assistant response and directly implements the preceding user's request. It forms a coherent standalone source-code family within that response.","response_event_index":3,"response_turn_id":"turn_000003","status":"complete","target_prompt_event_index":2,"target_prompt_id":"turn_000002"}},"first_generation_response":{"create_time":1709718519.965068,"event_index":3,"role":"assistant","source_node_id":"128be58a-92e5-4e69-ab62-74847b0e096d","source_parent_id":"aaa2ce65-9541-44c9-a75f-67f357057d68","source_record_index":3,"text":"以下は、Kotlinで文字列を画像に描画し、縁取りをするコード例です。このコードは`sksamuel/scrimage`ライブラリを使用しています。\n\n```kotlin\nimport com.sksamuel.scrimage.ImmutableImage\nimport com.sksamuel.scrimage.color.RGBColor\n\nfun main() {\n    // 画像の幅と高さを設定\n    val width = 400\n    val height = 200\n\n    // 画像を生成し、背景を白色で塗りつぶす\n    val image = ImmutableImage.filled(width, height, RGBColor.WHITE)\n\n    // 描画する文字列とフォントサイズを設定\n    val text = \"Hello, World!\"\n    val fontSize = 24f\n\n    // 文字列を描画する位置を設定\n    val x = 50\n    val y = 100\n\n    // 文字列の色と縁取りの色を設定\n    val textColor = RGBColor.WHITE\n    val outlineColor = RGBColor.BLACK\n\n    // 文字列を画像上に描画\n    image.awt().graphics.apply {\n        font = font.deriveFont(fontSize)\n        color = textColor.toAWTColor()\n        drawString(text, x, y)\n    }\n\n    // 文字列に縁取りを追加\n    val outlinedImage = image.awt().graphics.apply {\n        color = outlineColor.toAWTColor()\n        font = font.deriveFont(fontSize)\n        drawString(text, x - 1, y - 1)\n        drawString(text, x + 1, y - 1)\n        drawString(text, x - 1, y + 1)\n        drawString(text, x + 1, y + 1)\n    }\n\n    // 画像を保存\n    outlinedImage.dispose()\n    image.output(\"outlined_text.png\")\n}\n```\n\nこのコードは、指定された幅と高さの空の画像を作成し、指定された文字列を描画します。その後、縁取りを追加し、画像を保存します。","turn_id":"turn_000003"},"target_developer_prompt":{"create_time":1709718507.180084,"event_index":2,"role":"user","source_node_id":"aaa2ce65-9541-44c9-a75f-67f357057d68","source_parent_id":"25679324-c3ef-4986-8bd5-c27eba7e4a48","source_record_index":2,"text":"Kotlinのsksamuel/scrimageライブラリで、画像上に文字列を描画し、文字列の縁取りをするコードを生成してください。\n文字の色は白、縁は黒で描画します。","turn_id":"turn_000002"}},"csv_extraction":{"context":[{"category":"context","evidence_spans":["Kotlinのsksamuel/scrimageライブラリで"],"item_id":"context_1","normalized_text":"Kotlinのsksamuel/scrimageライブラリを使用する画像描画タスクである。","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]}],"specificity":[{"category":"specificity","evidence_spans":["画像上に文字列を描画し、文字列の縁取りをするコードを生成してください。"],"item_id":"specificity_1","normalized_text":"画像上に縁取りされた文字列を描画するコードを生成する。","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]},{"category":"specificity","evidence_spans":["文字の色は白、縁は黒で描画します。"],"item_id":"specificity_2","normalized_text":"文字色は白、縁取りは黒とする。","source_roles":["user"],"source_turn_ids":["turn_000002"]}],"verification":[{"category":"verification","evidence_spans":["文字の色は白、縁は黒で描画します。"],"item_id":"verification_1","normalized_text":